// Potential Snatch Ransomware Activity | T1204 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-emerging-threats/2019/Malware/Snatch/proc_creation_win_malware_snatch_ransomware.yml
DeviceProcessEvents
| where ProcessCommandLine matches regex "shutdown\\s+/r /f /t 00" or ProcessCommandLine matches regex "net\\s+stop SuperBackupMan"
